```{=html}
<div class="cards">
<% for (const it of items) { %><div class="card-p" <%= metadataAttrs(it) %>><% if (it.image) { %><div class="thumb"><img src="<%- it.image %>" alt="<%= it.title %>" loading="lazy"></div><% } %><div class="body"><div class="meta"><span><%= it.period %></span><span class="badge-s <%= it.status %>"><%= it.status %></span></div><h3><%= it.title %></h3><% if (it.role) { %><div class="role-l"><%= it.role %></div><% } %><p><%= it.summary %></p><div class="chips"><% for (const t of (it.tags || [])) { %><span class="chip"><%= t %></span><% } %></div><div class="links"><% for (const l of (it.links || [])) { %><a href="<%- l.url %>"><%= l.label %> →</a><% } %></div></div></div>
<% } %></div>
```
